                                "sense_id": "6ed36930-9de9-31f6-a215-5722ecf68c30",
                                "text": "“Kosher salt” is called thus, not because it is any more kosher than other types of salt, but because it is used in the kashering process of meat."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "bc006a69-4602-3519-90f3-607b1bb6627f",
